text I already know how I truly feel...
text What I lack is the courage to take that step forward.
text ...It's exactly as Sunohara said.
text I was hoping... that this would all come to an end with myself staying clean...
text ─I don't want to make them cry...
text ─I don't want to hurt them...
text ─I want things to stay like this...
text They are all fallacies... and excuses for how I feel when I face Ryou... and for myself...
text Those feelings are no lies.
text However, it's just for saving myself in the end.
text Now that it has come to this... there is no way this will end without hurting any one... including me.
text Instead, I was choosing to ignore everything to save myself...
