sound BCU.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The first card... standing for the past..."
sound BCV.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The reversed 'Death'... meaning failure to change..."
text At Kyou's prompting, I went to the courtyard, where Ryou was waiting.
text There, she confessed to me, and I accepted...
text Although I did not possess the emotion "love," we began our relationship...
bgload BG057E_M60_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
sound BCW.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The second card stands for the present, and it is... the reversed 'Strength.'"
sound BCX.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "Meaning confusion and timidity."
text Yesterday... she said those words while Kyou was right next to me.
text My feelings wavered, and I was indecisive and hesitant...
bgload BG057E_M120_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
sound BCY.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The third card which stands for the future... is the reversed 'The Hanged Man.'"
sound BCZ.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "This has the meaning of being egotistic and self-abandonment."
text The future... What I will do from now on...
text That's right... even though I accepted Ryou, I've kept going after Kyou...
text If this isn't egotistic, then what is...?
bgload BG057E_M180_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
sound BD0.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The fourth card is the solution to these problems."
sound BD1.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "It's the upright 'The Hierophant'... and it stands for assistance and generosity."
text The problem I am facing is who to choose in the end.
text Does that mean that there is something that will help me to arrive at the solution...?
text If that is the case...
text Then what Sunohara said earlier...
text Is that the "assistance" meant to help me to make a decision...?
bgload BG057E_M240_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
sound BD2.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The fifth card: the circumstances of your surroundings and your partner..."
sound BD3.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The reversed 'The Chariot'... its meaning is rivalry, dilemmas, and failure."
text The circumstances of my surroundings and my partner... in other words, that of Ryou...
text Ironically enough, that rival is her older twin sister...
bgload BG057E_M300_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
sound BD4.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The sixth card, which stands for your sub-consciousness and indicates your wish, is the reversed 'The Hermit.'"
sound BD5.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "It means... faithlessness and an unspeakable love..."
text The feelings that I cannot tell anyone that have been building up inside me...
text There's no way I could've told anyone...
text It's the person who paired me up together with Ryou... her sister...
text ...Her twin sister...
bgload BG057E_M360_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
sound BD6.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "The seventh card... it's the result that hints at what will happen."
sound BD7.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "It's the reversed 'Wheel of Fortune'..."
sound BD8.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "It stands for disagreements and jumping to conclusions..."
text Finally, the result...
text The fate that awaits me...
text Disagreements... and jumping to conclusions...
text This likely means I'll get to experience all this from now on...
bgload BG057E_M420_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
sound BD9.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "Tomoya-kun, this is the future that these cards will lead you to..."
sound BDA.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "Amidst regret, uneasiness, and weakness, you will be able to find your true self."
sound BDB.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "Please remember that you are not alone."
sound BDC.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "You may feel impatient from the conflicts you are facing, but that is also a path in itself."
sound BDD.aac
text @[Ryou]
text "As long as you stay true to your feelings, you should be able to return to the path you strayed from."
bgload BG057E_M480_SEPIA.jpg 0
setimg CGRY26_SEPIA.png
text Ryou... everything about your fortune... everything the tarot hinted at is all exactly right.
text Not a single thing turned out to be wrong...
text Then why...?
