text During afternoon class...
text Of course, I lay my head down on my desk and close my eyes.
text But I can't fall asleep...
text Inside of the pitch blackness, confusion and uneasiness continues to grow.
text Suddenly, I hear Ryou's voice.
text The teacher probably called on her...
text I can hear fluent English.
text Though I haven't the slightest idea what is being said.
text Then why...?
text ...Why does just hearing her voice make my heart ache...?
text Just for thinking about what I am about to do from here on out, it feels as if tears are welling up in my eyes...
text I...
music ~
text ...Am about to betray Ryou...
